'''''Battles Without Ninja and Humanity''''' is a [[Trailblaze Continuance]] in the chapter [[Banana Outrage: Battles Without Ninja and Humanity]].

==Steps==
# Interact with the camera and enter the Moment of Slumbernana
# The hunt has concluded, and all ninjas have assembled
# Return to Paperfold University
# (Optional) Check on the status of your classmates
# Head to the plaza to attend the opening ceremony of the school festival
# Talk to Welt and Himeko
# The Ninja Hero lingers in the shadows of the Dreamlands, heralding a new upcoming hunt...

