===The hunt has concluded, and all ninjas have assembled{{subst:void|<!--103421003-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Dreamflux Reef|update|The ultimate hunt is over, with the ninjas overcoming all the villains. The inhabitants of the Dreamlands can now enjoy a peaceful night's sleep, while for the Ninja Hero, this signals the beginning of a new adventure...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Perplexed Classmate:''' What is this place... Wasn't I just in class?
:'''Confounded Resident:''' Where have the... bananas and forest gone...
:'''March 7th:''' (Trailblazer), Dan Heng! And... Miss Rappa?
:'''Rappa:''' Yo, Ninja Ruri! Yo, Silvergun Shura!
:'''Boothill:''' Forkin' hell, they are making more of a scene than we are.
:'''"Profnana":''' How can it be... How could such mighty aspirations be brought down by a bunch of failed kindling...
:'''Rappa:''' Fiendling Chief, stop insulting others with your filthy language. The way of the ninja does not discriminate between classes...
:'''Rappa:''' One who seeks the way of the ninja is a Ninja Initiate. One who upholds the way of the ninja is a Ninja. And one who lives by the way of the ninja... is a Ninja Hero!
:'''"Profnana":''' ...I don't understand, bana.
:'''Boothill:''' Me neither... Wait, no more nonsense. There's no point in continuing the conversation with a monkey brought up by Dr. Primitive.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Have you decided on what to do with this guy?
:'''Boothill:''' Torture is definitely on the menu. Hah, whip him with a belt soaked in saltwater and serve him everything that the IPC once used on me.
:'''Rappa:''' The Fiendling Chief is guilty of multiple sins and deserves punishment. However, repentance is not what we seek, instead...
:'''Rappa & Boothill:''' Make him tell us where Evil Ninja Osaru is. / Make him tell us where Dr. Primitive is.
:'''"Profnana":''' ...
:'''Boothill:''' Yo, you enjoy playing dead? Let's see if you can still play dead in the face of a banana covered with thorns!
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Alright, cowboy actor, you don't have to continue acting with that puppet.
:'''Boothill:''' A puppet? You lil' fudgehead, even your toad looks more like a puppet than he does.
:...
:'''Mr. Reca:''' You've hurt the feelings of the assistant director. You really should work on changing your crude way of delivering lines.
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Go ahead if you really want to torture a prop. But a certain gorilla who has just awakened at the border of Asdana is probably about to depart.
:'''"Profnana":''' ...
:'''Rappa:''' Silvergun Shura, even with my super hearing, I'm no longer able to detect the sounds of the fiendling. Perhaps Ninja Gama is right.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He escaped?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A truly despicable fiendling!
:'''Boothill:''' Forkin' hell! That muddle-fudger still got away even after all our effort?
