===Return to Paperfold University{{subst:void|<!--103421004-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Penacony Paperfold University College|update|The story of ninjas and monkeys comes to a temporary close. As you all know, no matter what happens, academic life must continue, and the interrupted school festival must resume.<br />Join the truly joyous festival &mdash; Although your contributions may remain unrecognized to all, a ninja embodies the spirit of a mysterious hero who works in the shadows, seeking not fame but peace for all.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''March 7th:''' You guys actually experienced something so exciting... Seriously, bring me along on such adventures next time!
:'''Dan Heng:''' It was clearly you who went off on your own.
:'''March 7th:''' Forget it. Anyway, I was also able to showcase my capabilities while you guys weren't present. I definitely played a big part in your being able to resolve the situation so successfully.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Really?
