:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wow, you're the best.
::'''March 7th:''' Hey, why do you sound so snarky...
::As expected of Ninja Ruri!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} As expected of Ninja Ruri!
:'''March 7th:''' You're too kind, Ninja (Trailblazer).
:'''Dan Heng:''' The academic conference has concluded, and the actual acting dean and teachers are back.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

